ा ज्ञान अपने विषयसे अभिन्न रूप लिगसे उत्पन्न होता है, और अनुमान ज्ञान अपने विषयसे भिन्न रूप लिगसे उत्पन्न होता है, इसलिए इन्हे एक माननेमें विरोध आता है।</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [87.34, 199.80499999999998, 768.592, 628.6]}, {"polygon": [[112.74799999999999, 628.6], [635.2, 628.6], [635.2, 675.745], [112.74799999999999, 675.745]], "confidence": 0.9814600277359147, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 5, "html": "<p>★ ईहा व श्रुतज्ञानमे अन्तर—दे. श्रुतज्ञान 1/३,</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [112.74799999999999, 628.6, 635.2, 675.745]}, {"polygon": [[112.74799999999999, 677.99], [625.672, 677.99], [625.672, 722.89], [112.74799999999999, 722.89]], "confidence": 0.9814600277359147, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 6, "html": "<p>★ ईहा व अवग्रहमे अन्तर—दे. अवग्रह २/१/२,</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [112.74799999999999, 677.99, 625.672, 722.89]}, {"polygon": [[112.74799999999999, 727.38], [768.592, 727.38], [768.592, 814.935], [112.74799999999999, 814.935]], "confidence": 0.9814600277359147, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 7, "html": "<p>★ ईहादि तीन ज्ञानोंको मतिज्ञान व्यपदेश सम्बन्धी शंका समाधान—दे. मतिज्ञान ३।</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [112.74799999999999, 727.38, 768.592, 814.935]}, {"polygon": [[112.74799999999999, 819.425], [593.912, 819.425], [593.912, 871.0600000000001], [112.74799999999999, 871.0600000000001]], "confidence": 0.9814600277359147, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 8, "html": "<p>★ ईहा व धारणामे अन्तर—(दे. धारणा २)</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [112.74799999999999, 819.425, 593.912, 871.0600000000001]}, {"polygon": [[389.06, 1037.19], [450.99199999999996, 1037.19], [450.99199999999996, 1082.09], [389.06, 1082.09]], "confidence": 0.9814600277359147, "label": "SectionHeader", "raw_label": "Section-Header", "reading_order": 9, "html": "<h3>[उ]</h3>", "skipped": false, "erro